Clicking a trigger that reveals one FIELD of a block (`data-block-selector="uid#field"`, such as a cookie banner's trigger) no longer leaves every later block click ignored: the bridge looked for a block uid'd `uid#field`, never found it, and gave up without handing clicks back. A same-page fragment link let through with `data-linkable-allow` (a "Cookie settings" link) no longer marks the next load as in-page paging, which made an editor load within 5 seconds send PATH_CHANGE instead of INIT and never connect.
